===Etymology 2===
The {{glossary|adjective}} is derived from {{m|en||rid}}, the obsolete {{glossary|past participle}} form of {{m|en|ride}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=''adj.''{{sup|1}}|noformat=1|id=6286495916|date=December 2024}}</ref>

====Adjective====
{{en-adj|-}}

# ''As the second word in a {{glossary|compound}}'': {{synonym of|en|ridden|t=[[full#Adjective|full]] of; also, [[dominate#Verb|dominated]], [[oppress]]ed, or [[plague#Verb|plagued]] by|nocap=1}}.
# {{lb|en|postpositive|obsolete}} ''Only in'' '''well-rid''': of a [[horse#Noun|horse]]: [[ride#Verb|ridden]].

